{"v":4,"catch":"你能發現每一個細節嗎？與細節獵人一起迎接挑戰！","desc":"深入體驗 Detail Hunter，這款一流的找茬遊戲，將考驗您對細節的注意力！體驗生動的卡通風格視覺效果和具有挑戰性的謎題的世界。探索各種動態環境，選擇難度級別，並在與時間賽跑時明智地使用提示。揭露隱藏的秘密並提高你的偵探技能，成為終極的細節獵人。無論您是想放鬆身心還是挑戰自我，這款遊戲都能為各地敏銳的觀察者提供身臨其境、令人興奮的體驗。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2024-12-26","genres":["街機","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c612ea1751195c00af9afaa1a378ceda86b8198f69f9f459d088947f1d01eea3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8eb10fdf785981f8c2939b6210e72d1e973819012ce73821a11879cf3a6d136.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb11dbfe6107cd3388185263cc2b803c0e1f1230002fc075f1197451a3c978d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ebcfff1b99f8b0318a35a2638609cd9fb2260ae682cacf4b8a91c7367a5e887d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c91ed557c705c0fcdb04b5f03fd98ca343273e54a2ef02e3ecc0682516f77eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f16d9523facb83c284739656f244aa9529ece08e6874d56ece49291ca6428006.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f33020d02000","dlc":[]}